OL,3,GNEWSAMunch print found at estate set
OL,4,Afor auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA print by Norwegian artist Edvard
OL,7,FMunch that has remained in the same
OL,8,Ffamily for more than 50 years is
OL,9,Fexpected to sell for up to #80,000 at
OL,10,Fauction.
OL,12,FThe work, Melancholy III, was
OL,13,Fdiscovered at a private estate in north
OL,14,FKent and was listed to be sold by
OL,15,FCatherine Southon Auctioneers in London
OL,16,Fon 28 October.
OL,18,FCreated in 1902, the artwork was found
OL,19,Fwith its original receipt showing it
OL,20,Fwas bought in Norway in 1969 for 42,000
OL,21,FNorwegian kroner, the equivalent to
OL,22,Fabout #3,300 in recent exchange rates.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
