OL,3,GNEWSAMunch print found at estate set
OL,4,Afor auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe woodcut, which was printed from a
OL,7,Fcarved block, shows a person near the
OL,8,Fsea, contrasting with the apparent
OL,9,Fintimacy of a couple walking towards a
OL,10,Frowing boat, according to the auction
OL,11,Fhouse.
